    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί-γονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twice-born,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					560
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.524.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>twin: double,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάσθλης δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					129
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίτονον</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; δ. σώματα</span>
			<i>two</i> bodies, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				1178
			</span></i> (lyr.); but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			parox., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διγόνος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
			<i>bearing twice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				69
			</span></i>; <i>bearing twins,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Man.
				5.291
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίγονος: περιστερά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
